SUMMARY:Authentic Relating Date Night For Singles: Ditch The Small Talk (*
 pre-paid tix*)
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Authentic Relating Date Night For Singl
 es: Ditch The Small Talk**\n\nRegister for a Women's ticket: [https://pci.
 jotform.com/form/260924937490163](https://pci.jotform.com/form/26092493749
 0163)\n\nRegister for a Men's ticket: SOLD OUT - you can add yourself to t
 he waitlist [here](https://pci.jotform.com/form/252528201177150)\n\n\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nBuild skills to deepen your connections and meet poten
 tial matches who resonate with the real you.\n\nThis event is designed to 
 help you move past surface-level conversations and create authentic\, mean
 ingful connections -- both in the moment and long after. You’ll also pra
 ctice communication tools that can transform how you date and relate.\n\nY
 ou can absolutely make a romantic connection at this event. But whether yo
 u meet your match or not\, you’ll leave with lasting skills to approach 
 dating and relationships with more ease and depth.\n\n**What to expect:**\
 n\\- A supportive and playful space to practice being truly seen\n\\- Acti
 vities that help you break out of habitual small talk and connect authenti
 cally\n\\- Practical skills to build deeper\\\, more fulfilling connection
 s from the first interaction\n\\- The opportunity to meet new friends and 
 make romantic matches\n\n*Though adults of all ages are welcome\, we antic
 ipate that most participants will be in their 30s to 50s.*\n\nAt the end o
 f the evening\, you’ll have the chance to privately select who you’d l
 ike to connect with further. If there’s a mutual match\, we’ll share y
 our contact info with each other.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**When & Where
 :**\nThursday\, April 30th\n6:45–9:30 PM (Arrivals at 6:45\, activities 
 begin at 7PM)\nThe Well\, Asheville\n\n**Tickets:**\nSliding scale: $45–
 $65 ($55 suggested)\n\nWe offer this range to balance accessibility with h
 onoring the time and energy it takes to create the event. Please choose th
 e highest amount that’s sustainable for you — your support helps keep 
 these events happening.\n\nThis event is designed for women who want to da
 te men and men who want to date women. We will offer an equal number of ti
 ckets to both groups. If you identify as non-binary\, please purchase the 
 ticket that reflects how you would like to participate on the night of the
  event.\n\nRegister for a Women's ticket: [https://pci.jotform.com/form/26
 0924937490163](https://pci.jotform.com/form/260924937490163)\n\nRegister f
 or a Men's ticket: SOLD OUT - you can add yourself to the waitlist [here](
 https://pci.jotform.com/form/252528201177150)\n\n**Note: Attendance is lim
 ited and these events have sold out in the past\, so register as soon as y
 ou are a full YES to reserve your spot.**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nRefund P
 olicy: We do not offer refunds\, but attendees are encouraged to sell thei
 r ticket to another same-gender person if they are no longer able to atten
 d. If you sell your ticket to another attendee\, please let us know who is
  taking your ticket. If we are able to give your spot to someone off the w
 aitlist\, we will refund your ticket\, but note that we cannot guarantee t
 his option. \\*\\*Please let us know if you will not be able to attend -- 
 gender balance matters for this event.\\*\\*\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nInter
 ested in an LGBTQIA+ event? Let us know — we’ll create one if there’
 s enough interest.\n\nCome play\, connect deeply\, and bring relating skil
 ls into your dating and relationships. ![❤️](https://static.xx.fbcdn.n
 et/images/emoji.php/v9/ted/2/16/2764.png)
