DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Authentic Relating Date Night For Singl
 es: Ditch The Small Talk**\n\nRegister for a Women's ticket (only 3 spots 
 left!): [https://pci.jotform.com/form/260924937490163](https://pci.jotform
 .com/form/260924937490163)\n\nRegister for a Men's ticket: SOLD OUT - you 
 can add yourself to the waitlist [here](https://pci.jotform.com/form/25252
 8201177150)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nBuild skills to deepen your conne
 ctions and meet potential matches who resonate with the real you.\n\nThis 
 event is designed to help you move past surface-level conversations and cr
 eate authentic\, meaningful connections -- both in the moment and long aft
 er. You’ll also practice communication tools that can transform how you 
 date and relate.\n\nYou can absolutely make a romantic connection at this 
 event. But whether you meet your match or not\, you’ll leave with lastin
 g skills to approach dating and relationships with more ease and depth.\n\
 n**What to expect:**\n\\- A supportive and playful space to practice being
  truly seen\n\\- Activities that help you break out of habitual small talk
  and connect authentically\n\\- Practical skills to build deeper\\\, more 
 fulfilling connections from the first interaction\n\\- The opportunity to 
 meet new friends and make romantic matches\n\n*Though adults of all ages a
 re welcome\, we anticipate that most participants will be in their 30s to 
 50s.*\n\nAt the end of the evening\, you’ll have the chance to privately
  select who you’d like to connect with further. If there’s a mutual ma
 tch\, we’ll share your contact info with each other.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\n\n**When & Where:**\nThursday\, April 30th\n6:45–9:30 PM (Arrivals 
 at 6:45\, activities begin at 7PM)\nThe Well\, Asheville\n\n**Tickets:**\n
 Sliding scale: $45–$65 ($55 suggested)\n\nWe offer this range to balance
  accessibility with honoring the time and energy it takes to create the ev
 ent. Please choose the highest amount that’s sustainable for you — you
 r support helps keep these events happening.\n\nThis event is designed for
  women who want to date men and men who want to date women. We will offer 
 an equal number of tickets to both groups. If you identify as non-binary\,
  please purchase the ticket that reflects how you would like to participat
 e on the night of the event.\n\nRegister for a Women's ticket: [https://pc
 i.jotform.com/form/260924937490163](https://pci.jotform.com/form/260924937
 490163)\n\nRegister for a Men's ticket: SOLD OUT - you can add yourself to
  the waitlist [here](https://pci.jotform.com/form/252528201177150)\n\n**No
 te: Attendance is limited and these events have sold out in the past\, so 
 register as soon as you are a full YES to reserve your spot.**\n\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\nRefund Policy: We do not offer refunds\, but attendees are en
 couraged to sell their ticket to another same-gender person if they are no
  longer able to attend. If you sell your ticket to another attendee\, plea
 se let us know who is taking your ticket. If we are able to give your spot
  to someone off the waitlist\, we will refund your ticket\, but note that 
 we cannot guarantee this option. \\*\\*Please let us know if you will not 
 be able to attend -- gender balance matters for this event.\\*\\*\n\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nInterested in an LGBTQIA+ event? Let us know — we’ll c
 reate one if there’s enough interest.\n\nCome play\, connect deeply\, an
 d bring relating skills into your dating and relationships. ![❤️](http
 s://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/ted/2/16/2764.png)
