SUMMARY:Intuitive Full Moon Ceremony with Magi Caswell
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nDescription of event:\n\nCome join me for
  a Full Moon Ceremony to help us deeply connect with the energies and soul
  initiations of the moon. I will help guide you through a channeled soul j
 ourney experience where we will connect with how the astrology is personal
 ly rising up for you In your own life.\n\nThese ceremonies are meant to he
 lp you move through\, illuminate and alchemize the patterns that you are r
 eady to let go of\, and the ones you are ready to step into. I utilize my 
 tools of creating sacred space\, guided soul journeys\, sound healing\, an
 d embodiment practices. These tools help us get clear within ourselves abo
 ut what is true for us. So that we can move forward in directions that are
  aligned with who we truly are.\n\nDonations Welcome.
