SUMMARY:Energy Circle with Archangel Raphael 
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nLets set a sacred space to invite Angel R
 aphael into our circle. Archangel Raphael\, the healing Angel\, would like
  to work with us on issues big and small. Even those issues we think of as
  too mundane for healing are still based in spirit!\n\nRaphael can be in m
 any places at once\, and can work with each of us one-on-one\, even as we 
 sit in a workshop together. He supports each of us to land fully in our bo
 dies\, in the moment\, and to be present with our inner selves. He support
 s our bodies\, emotions\, and spirit as we move through our daily lives.\n
 \nHe loves working with us humans and is very gentle in his work. During t
 his session you’ll learn how to connect with Raphael on your own\, after
  the class. We’ll run through the process that I’ve used for many year
 s to communicate and work with him.\n\nANGEL ESSENCE ENERGY HEALING - Lisa
  has been a practitioner of Angel Essence Energy healing for almost two de
 cades. This gentle and supportive healing modality assists with practical 
 issues\, deeper transitions\, and everything in between. Lisa has worked w
 ith individuals\, couples\, groups\, animals\, and with nature directly.\n
 \nDonations Welcome.
